    "title": "fix: serve private downloads without presigned redirects",
    "body": "Import/export files, private media and digital product downloads are now delivered through Shopware instead of redirecting the browser to a presigned object-storage URL. In one hosting setup the private storage endpoint is reachable by Shopware but not by the browser, so the redirect fails there. The existing `private_local_download_strategy` setting decides how the file is delivered.",
